            <ArticleTitle>[Two new triterpenoid glycosides from leaves of Ilex latifolia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3036-3041</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4268/cjcmm20161616</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two new triterpenoid glycosides, latifolosides R and S (1 and 2), were isolated from the leaves of Ilex latifolia by various column chromatographic methods. Their structures were elucidated based on NMR spectroscopic data and chemical evidence.</AbstractText>
